WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:03.879
SCP-035 Vs SCP-096.

00:00:03.879 --> 00:00:09.130
The Possessive Mask Vs The Shy Guy, two forces
of terrifying malice and destruction.

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:10.580
But who would win?

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:16.440
SCP-096 enters a rage state when anyone sees
its face, being both indestructible and unstoppable

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:17.590
under these conditions.

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:24.240
However, the real question is whether SCP-035
really sees, meaning it may not activate 096’s

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:26.320
aggression at all.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:31.029
SCP-035 is a dangerous, mind-controlling mask
with evil intentions that slowly melts its

00:00:31.029 --> 00:00:32.029
hosts.

00:00:32.029 --> 00:00:38.010
However, we would argue that these two might
be a match made in Hell: SCP-096 may love

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:43.899
having its face covered by a mask, and 035
would love having an indestructible body.

00:00:43.899 --> 00:00:47.950
If we put these two up against each other,
we’d be the ones in trouble.

